<title>USA: Adaptec sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Adaptec sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adaptec said its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split, which will be payable November 15 to shareholders of record November 1.</p>
</text>
